WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:05.820
Miriam has been in Tijuana with her daughters
for a couple of days.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:10.740
The journey from Honduras has been long and
difficult.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:15.780
Their goal is almost within reach - the US
border.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:21.689
They don't want to stay in Mexico for long
- the authorities have little to offer them:

00:00:21.689 --> 00:00:26.500
They are making no effort to provide food.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.820
To be honest, the food they are giving us
is awful.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:35.680
Look, here are beans that you would only give
to pigs.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.120
But we have to eat it, because otherwise we'll
die of hunger.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:47.530
They will sleep on the floor again tonight
in the city stadium, which the local authorities

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:51.360
have provided as a makeshift shelter.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:59.230
They have been overwhelmed by the migrants,
who have come in greater numbers than expected.

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:08.250
Mario Osuna, who manages the improvised shelter,
says they're dependent on government support.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:13.020
We were simply not prepared for this.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:16.750
We have no contingency funds, we rely on the
federal government for those.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:21.840
We can set up shelters out back, in the fields,
and provide assistance.

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:25.960
But a lot of federal support is needed for
us to help the people who are already here,

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:33.280
and are still to arrive

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:37.579
They need as much as four million dollars,
according to the spokesman for the State Human

00:01:37.579 --> 00:01:39.969
Rights Commission.

00:01:39.969 --> 00:01:47.170
He admits that the city is currently unprepared
for the impending arrival of more migrants.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:56.069
There's not enough staff to receive all those
who will arrive.

00:01:56.069 --> 00:01:58.460
That is why we have been putting pressure
on the government.

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:04.049
An application for about 80 million pesos
was submitted to the federal government.

00:02:04.049 --> 00:02:09.940
That's how much the local government estimates
will be needed for the migrants."+++

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:16.450
Some locals have been dreading the arrival
of the Central Americans, fearing chaos and

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:22.860
costs.

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.690
They have to relieve themselves.

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:25.800
Where will they do it?

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:28.670
There is no capacity at the sports facility.

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:34.580
There aren't enough toliets for that many
people"We have given them a place to sleep,

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:35.580
drinks and food.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.950
But then in the news, we see that they are
ungrateful.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:42.130
That's truly disappointing.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:47.280
I was just starting my motorbike, when a boy
insulted me.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:53.090
We almost got into a fight because he offended
me.

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:58.450
Increasing tensions have led local authorities
to impose tough security rules.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:03.340
The migrants are not allowed to enter or leave
the stadium after 10 at night.

